From 45fdf02e7794b3a9f7b2bcf58dd58ccd6828ac96 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JingMatrix <jingmatrix@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 21:20:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/47] Build the whole module with Gradle

One Gradle graph replaces package.sh: AGP builds the daemon dex, CMake externalNativeBuild builds both interceptors and an internal BoringSSL per ABI, and the prepareModule/zip tasks assemble the flashable module (with per-manager install tasks). CMakeLists builds BoringSSL itself instead of taking a prebuilt path. CI runs ./gradlew zip.
